      "message": "[error] Line 862: 🔴 `ensureBundleDtlsContext` now enqueues the DTLS handshake onto `ThreadPool::io()` and then blocks waiting on `dtlsCv_`. This can deadlock when the caller itself is already running on the IO pool (which happens via `ExternalMediaConference::startMedia`), especially with a single/saturated IO worker: the waiting thread consumes the worker that must execute the queued handshake. Please avoid scheduling-and-waiting on the same pool (run negotiation inline when already on an IO worker, or dispatch to a different pool/thread) so progress is guaranteed.",
